{"id":405,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"仏教精神でこころを育てる武蔵野大","feature_description":"武蔵野大学中学校・高等学校は、仏教精神に基づくこころ教育を土台に、教育の3つの目的を掲げて学ぶ中高一貫校です。異なる学年の生徒が交わる部活動が多く、学びだけでなく日々の活動を通して新しい自分を発見しやすい環境です。大学附属のつながりを生かしながら、進学実績や多彩な体験も整えています。学年を越えた交流が毎日に刺激を与えます。","clubs":[{"id":7687,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.musashino-u.ed.jp/j-highschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7688,"name":"バレーボール部（男子は高校のみ）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.musashino-u.ed.jp/j-highschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7689,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.musashino-u.ed.jp/j-highschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7690,"name":"ハンドボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.musashino-u.ed.jp/j-highschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7691,"name":"軟式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.musashino-u.ed.jp/j-highschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7692,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.musashino-u.ed.jp/j-highschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7693,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.musashino-u.ed.jp/j-highschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7694,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.musashino-u.ed.jp/j-highschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7695,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.musashino-u.ed.jp/j-highschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7696,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.musashino-u.ed.jp/j-highschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7697,"name":"競技ドッジボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.musashino-u.ed.jp/j-highschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7698,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.musashino-u.ed.jp/j-highschool/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7699,"name":"茶道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"http